  "$id": "https://loom.invalid/schemas/state-v2/contract.json",
  "title": "Loom durable storage envelopes, schema 2",
  "description": "Canonical jq -cS JSON plus newline; runtime also enforces UTF-8 byte bounds, duplicate rejection, safe numbers, no NUL, unique kind/ID changes, cross-field identity, revision CAS, run epoch and hash chains. Domain payload semantics belong to S3/S6/S7.",
